  m_text: "<b>Scene Condition:</b>\r\n- Victor\u2019s wine glass on desk contained
    poison residue\r\n- opened wine bottle on dining table with multiple fingerprints\r\n-
    No clear signs of violent struggle in the study.\r\n\r\n<b>Persons of interest:</b>
    Anna (wife), Brian (friend), Charles (childhood friend), Dana (colleague), Edward
    (business partner).\r\n\r\n<b>Investigator notes:</b>\r\n- Interviews witnesses
    for timeline reconciliation\r\n- Gather evidences and clues\r\n\r\n<b>Note:</b>\r\n-
    Body removed prior to investigator arrival\r\n- Only trace evidence remains\u200B"
