  - evidenceID: Wine Bottle
    discoveredPicture: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5af1ef376509b45c89a463ecd1bd5ec7, type: 3}
    discoveredName: Wine Bottle
    detailedInformation: Victor consumed wine from this bottle, and it carries numerous
